Upstream-Name: pluto-tx
Upstream-Contact: Jochen Hammes <hammesj@me.com>
Source: https://github.com/jochenhammes/pluto-tx
Comment: The binary package bundles prebuilt third-party components in
 /usr/lib/pluto-tx and /usr/share/pluto-tx/js8 (versions: packaging/components.lock).
 Their license texts are in /usr/share/doc/pluto-tx/licenses/.
 The matching sources are published with each release as sources-<version>.tar.xz.
 .
 Open license question (docs/RELEASE_PLAN.md R0.4, HALT before publishing):
 gr-m17's top-level LICENSE and its libm17 submodule carry the GPL-2.0 text
 without a version clause, while gr-m17's own source files are marked
 GPL-3.0-or-later.

